> Is it normal for gods to 
> hand out +5 artifacts? I'm pretty sure I've never seen one above +1.

The chance drops off exponentially.  So it's possible to see an
artifact well over +5 if you play millions of games.  Because there
are only a couple dozen possible artifacts, chances are you'll get
only all at +0 or +1 most of the time.  But the RNG does strange
things with random numbers.

